  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the mushrooms and onion into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Sauté the mushrooms and onion in butter until tender.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in flour to make a roux, then gradually add milk, whisking continuously.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook until thickened.",
    "Stir in shredded cheddar cheese until melted.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and garnish with katsuramuki-cut mushrooms.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes, or until golden brown and set.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving."
